Oh, I suppose that's a discussion we could have.

9
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:28,450
那太好了  我觉得呢
Okay, great, I mean,

10
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:30,880
也不见得一定得是盛大的派对之类的
it doesn't have to be a big party or anything.

11
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:31,830
我只是...
I was just...

12
00:00:35,690 --> 00:00:36,910
他上哪去了
Where'd he go?

13
00:00:36,910 --> 00:00:37,900
等等
W-Wait a minute.

14
